## 0.11.0

### Added
- OpenRouter terminology cleanup across help text, comments, and man page.
- Provider-neutral AI speaker language for transcript/log-facing documentation.

### Changed
- Removed stale provider terminology from the ncurses client source where it described current behavior.
- Config path documentation now consistently uses `~/.config/ttychatter/openrouter/config`.
- Model/browser documentation now describes OpenRouter model catalog behavior.

### Documentation
- Updated man page to use OpenRouter chat-completions and model-catalog language.
- Updated comments around provider transport to avoid stale provider naming.

### Notes
- This is a cleanup pass; no intended ncurses runtime feature expansion beyond terminology/provider coherence.
